quiz 3 | Pressure 20 m under water (ρ = 1000, g = 10), not counting the atmosphere?
* 200 kPa
o 20 kPa
o 2 MPa
o 100 kPa
= ρgh = 200,000 Pa: about 2 atmospheres.
